this package provides pfring and pfring-dkms rpm version 8.6.1.

To make the rpm packages :

* pfring : use mock environment setup running make rpm
* pfring-dkms : need to be run in a clean machine having following packages installed :
    * yum group install 'Development Tools'
    * yum install dkms

    * run make dkms-rpm to make the pfinrg-dkms rpm

results can be found in packages/rpm/pkgs
